OL,3,ACold War missile tucked away in a field
OL,4,Ahides love story for man's late wife   
OL,6,FA 20ft-long Cold War era missile       
OL,7,Fperched on the back of a truck in a    
OL,8,Ffield has become a hit on TikTok - and 
OL,9,Frevealed a love story behind it.       
OL,11,FPhotos and videos of the striking sight
OL,12,Fnear Llangollen, Denbighshire, spread  
OL,13,Facross social media, prompting         
OL,14,Fspeculation, theories and curious      
OL,15,Fcomments from people wondering how it  
OL,16,Fgot there and why.                     
OL,18,FBut for the man who owns it, the story 
OL,19,Fhas nothing to do with secret military 
OL,20,Foperations or preparations for war - it
OL,21,Fis about him using an unusual hobby to 
OL,22,Fhonour his late wife.                  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
