OL,3,ACold War missile tucked away in a field
OL,4,Ahides love story for man's late wife   
OL,6,FAdrian Hyde, 59, admits it has now "all
OL,7,Fjust snowballed and I've got carried   
OL,8,Faway" and has spent about #200,000 on  
OL,9,Fnumerous vehicles.                     
